  "Posted 'Bplan/Dtf', 'Insur/aim high', 'Insights/Staging', 'Ctrl/Tunnel', 'Sry Bout Mess/BPro', 'All Wings/Dlighter Spin', 'Houjix/Outa Nowhere' and 'OOC/TT' dested as the combo cards; 'Fades' Menace Fades; 'Cele' Tatooine Celebration (the strategy names it); 'Legendary' Legendary Starfighter; 'x-laser' X-wing Laser Cannon; 'Clash' Clash Of Sabers.",
